      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HERA ROLEX (1) is a well performed dog and winner of 10 races who is worth forgiving after finishing out of the placings at The Gardens (35.75). Has a strong record from box 1, including two wins. Worth another chance. RAPID LULU (2) continues to race in super honest form hitting the frame at 24 of 43 starts runs and has won two of last three, the latest winning (19.87) over 352m at this track. Solid record here at the distance winning two races. Super consistent and can feature with the right run. BLUE LAKODA (6) was safely held in tougher company last start after losing her position early at this track, but prior to that won by 0.8 lengths at this track (19.78) beating Butternut Queen in a Grade 5 on August 5. Has a strong record out of this box with three wins and two minor placings from seven starts. Can do much better this time. SMOOTH PANTHER (7) missed the placings here last start but is well-placed to turn the form around.",
